# Single source of truth for the Debian packages built from this repo's
# precompiled installer binaries. Consumed by packaging/build-deb.sh and the
# apt-repo GitHub Actions workflow.
#
# Format (one package per non-comment line, fields separated by '|'):
#   pkgname | source_c | binary_name | install_dir | short_description
#
# - pkgname       Debian package name (also the apt install name).
# - source_c      C source under installer/linux/ used to build the binary.
# - binary_name   the compiled binary's filename.
# - install_dir   absolute target directory inside the package (no leading ./).
# - short_desc    one-line Description: synopsis.
#
# Shared metadata (version, maintainer, architecture, section) is defined in
# build-deb.sh so it stays consistent across every package.

os-security-installer  | os_security_installer.c        | os-security-installer  | usr/sbin | Native OS security baseline installer (ClamAV/UFW/AppArmor/fail2ban)
git-improved-installer | git_improved_installer.c       | git-improved-installer | usr/sbin | Native improved-Git installer (modern git + git-lfs + companions)
white-installer        | white_installer_orchestrator.c | white-installer        | usr/bin  | Ubuntu White Edition smooth install orchestrator
desktop-install-probe  | desktop_install_probe.c        | desktop_install_probe  | usr/bin  | Desktop install discovery and bootstrap probe
nxtt                   | nxtt-uninstaller.c             | nxtt                   | usr/bin  | NXTT uninstaller helper
